            "text": "If I spin the wheel... will you be happy?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "760550314"
            ]
          },
          "760550314": {
            "id": "760550314",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Pavlov",
            "text": "(Of course, of course! People play with me, the wheel plays with me, and there's good food... the food is the best part!)",
